Third-party components
----------------------
vendor/touchtune/TouchTune-1.2.1.zip
  TouchTune 1.2.1, GPL-3.0-or-later (copyright holder and source: see NOTICE and SOURCE.txt in the zip)
  Shipped unmodified; the USB launcher mechanism and the root remount, watchdog
  and SafeReboot handling follow it.

vendor/oem-aa-mod/oem-aa-mod-0.10.0.zip
  oem-aa-mod 0.10.0 by Vitaliy Kurokhtin, AGPL-3.0,
  https://github.com/VitaliyKurokhtin/oem-aa-mod
  Only libpatch-blmjciaapa.so is used, unmodified.

meters/fonts/
  Chakra Petch and Share Tech Mono (google/fonts), SIL Open Font License 1.1,
  with their license texts alongside.

Idea credits: MZD-AIO additionalApps.js (GPL-3.0) for the userscript approach.

No Mazda or JCI files are included. The scripts only contain hashes of the stock
files they expect and the lines they insert. MiatOff is not affiliated with or endorsed by Mazda.
